      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7489,
        "name": "Nibelung",
        "desc": "<p>The leader of the elemental dragons and the primeval creator of Teyvat.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/03/03/237301566/596896f7ea3d51d7b1f6e504094f9d97_4010709984094972573.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "The primeval dragon created three Moon Goddesses and the Three Moons, and raised them to the sky. During the",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "name": "War of Funerary Flame",
        "desc": "<p>The war between the Dragon Lord Nibelung and the Heavenly Principles that took place 6,000 years ago.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/21/237301566/693da8a1b01352fde999598e49b34fde_8792145013995754059.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Nibelung imprisoned the Moon Goddesses and turned their Moons into weapons.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "name": "Moon Goddesses",
        "desc": "<p>Aria, Sonnet, and Canon — three sisters and Moon Goddesses who once ruled the firmament. Columbina Hyposelenia is a Moon Goddess who was born thousands of years after the Three Moon's death.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/04/07/237301566/1f76253cb02cf46c0f6d8b836271b6f2_7450418426638299855.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Aria is the Goddess of the Eternal Moon — the biggest of the Tree Moons. Her power gave rise to the ocean tides.\nMoon Marrow\nThe Eternal Moon shard that contains Aria's powers. The Moonchanter",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8396,
        "name": "Lauma",
        "desc": "A Maiden blessed by moonlight and the grove alike, hope born to the Frostmoon Scions.",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/08/b06e9ff48d57de4856f1a05b1199aae1_8565150401481594895.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "keeps the Eternal Moon's marrow.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9339,
        "name": "Sonnet",
        "desc": "<p>The Goddess of the Iridescent Moon.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/20/237301566/60ceaba0c8911e94ed390a1c10e39c67_8833187668476967228.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9340,
        "name": "Canon",
        "desc": "<p>The Goddess of the Frost Moon.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/20/237301566/83ad656e45f97e90387a110a29206acf_6638456880554064410.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Aria is Canon and Sonnet's older sister.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7476,
        "name": "Columbina",
        "desc": "<p>The Trilune Goddess and the former Third of the Eleven Fatui Harbingers, known as Damselette. Her real name is Columbina Hyposelenia.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/15/237301566/5e2419a3a72fa7e5e3b9f9009281dbbb_5980869753315871646.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "The new Moon Goddess. Aria, Sonnet, and Canon gave her their powers, thus making her the Trilune Goddess.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7106,
        "name": "Fatui",
        "desc": "<p>A Snezhnayan organization that is loyal to the Tsaritsa and has spread out all over the continent. Its Harbingers are on the hunt for the Gnoses.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/23/237301566/38c409297992d7a782f0f1312f311707_3548311870444408788.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "The Fatui are studying the remnants of the Eternal Moon.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
